      "incumbent": true,
      "summary": "John McGuire is the incumbent U.S. Representative for Virginia's 5th Congressional District, first elected in 2024 after defeating incumbent Bob Good in a hotly contested primary. A former U.S. Navy SEAL and business owner, McGuire previously served in the Virginia Senate (2024\u20132025) and Virginia House of Delegates (2018\u20132024). His campaign focuses on tax cuts, affordability, and his work on the Wintergreen Emergency Egress Act and the American Dream Act.",
